{"ID":"20240220132655-mwsbbz1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132655-mwsbbz1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132655-mwsbbz1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312141935-99bxyoc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312141935-r21ilp2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312141935-r21ilp2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:271,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:271\u0026#125;","title":"【桂枝去芍药加附子汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312141935"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312141935-99bxyoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312141935-99bxyoc","updated":"20240312141935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312141935-vlbv0uo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312141935-vlbv0uo","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312141935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：太阳病，下之后，脉促，胸满者，桂枝去芍药汤主之。若微恶寒者，桂枝去芍药方中加附子汤主之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312141935-1fw9hdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312141935-1fw9hdg","updated":"20240312141935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他有时候把芍药拿掉，有时候把附子加进去，同样桂枝汤在应变，这个处方我们可以看出几件事情，第一个胸满，所有经方，从伤寒到金匮，只要有胸满出现的时候，张仲景就不用白芍。所以我们知道"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心脏病是不用白芍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的。祛痰也不用白芍。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为白芍是酸苦，白芍味酸，酸苦涌泄为阴。如果我们把阴当成静脉，桂枝是动脉的时候，你把白芍拿掉，血流回心脏的速度就会减缓下来，就会让心脏得到喘息。所以胸满者，胸满的人一律不用白芍。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸满的定义很广，包括你气呼不过来，你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胸口心脏满，胸口痛，刺痛统统叫胸满"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不用白芍。后面会介绍到只要有腹痛，小腹痛，白芍都要重用。胸满的时候一律不用白芍。\n“微恶寒者，桂枝去芍药方中加附子。”因为你太阳病已经攻下了，脉促，胸满者，微恶寒者。里面恶寒就是里虚掉，因为你攻下，攻下了以后如果病人里虚掉，这个时候我没加点附子下去，把里面的阳温回来。"}]},{"ID":"20240312141935-r21ilp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312141935-r21ilp2","updated":"20240312141935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝去芍药汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三两，甘草二两炙，大枣十二枚，生姜三两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水七升，微火煮取三升，去滓，适寒温，服一升。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝去芍药加附子汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三两，生姜三两，甘草二两炙，大枣十二枚，附子一枚炮，去皮破八片。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味，以水七升，微火煮取三升，去滓，适寒温，服一升。若一服恶寒止，停后服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n一服恶寒止，就不要再服了。我常会问病人怕不怕冷，因为发表药开多了，表虚了也会冷，病人会有微恶寒。\n处方说微恶寒和极恶寒不一样，病人会稍微感到怕冷点代表表虚掉了。一般来说，如果是遇到温病的，表虚了，我们开黄芪，黄芪固表，经方，黄芪太慢了，炮附子一下去收表。"}]}]}